  "steps": [
    "Cake: cream the butter and sugar, beat in the eggs, then add the milk, flour and baking powder.",
    "Toss the blueberries in a little flour in a sieve and fold them in. Pour into a greased tin lined with baking paper.",
    "Bake in a preheated oven at 180 °C for about 45 minutes.",
    "Ninho cream: beat the butter until fluffy, then beat in the cold condensed milk, cream and milk powder.",
    "Brigadeiro: cook the condensed milk, cream and butter, stirring, until it thickens. Stir in milk powder to taste and finish with lemon zest.",
    "Split the cake, fill with the cream and cover with the brigadeiro."
